{
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "uid": "foundation-shared-resources",
  "title": "Foundation · 共享资源与健康",
  "version": 1,
  "tags": [
    "Foundation",
    "diagnostics"
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "服务总览",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/ack-service-overview",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "title": "容器与节点",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/ack-container-overview",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "title": "应用组件",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/ack-application-components",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "title": "共享资源与健康",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/foundation-shared-resources",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "01 · 共享 Queue — 同一逻辑队列快照去重",
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "逻辑队列任务数（按状态）",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (env,cluster,queue_destination,state) (queue_tasks{env=~\"${env}\",cluster=~\"${cluster}\",queue_destination=~\"${queue_name}\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{env}} / {{cluster}} · {{queue_destination}} / {{state}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "同一逻辑队列多个observer取max，禁止sum。不同Store必须配置不同逻辑队列名；max不能自动识别后端冲突。 各逻辑队列与状态独立画线，不跨队列或环境堆叠。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未接入 / 无样本",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "fillOpacity": 6,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "最老就绪等待年龄",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (env,cluster,queue_destination) (queue_oldest_ready_age_seconds{env=~\"${env}\",cluster=~\"${cluster}\",queue_destination=~\"${queue_name}\"} and (queue_stats_collection_success{env=~\"${env}\",cluster=~\"${cluster}\",queue_destination=~\"${queue_name}\"} == 1) and (queue_stats_oldest_ready_known{env=~\"${env}\",cluster=~\"${cluster}\",queue_destination=~\"${queue_name}\"} == 1))",
          "legendFormat": "{{env}} / {{cluster}} · {{queue_destination}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "只包含当前Ready任务的AvailableAt年龄；重试/延迟排期会改变它，不是任务自创建以来总年龄。统计失败或年龄未知不输出样本，不能解释为空队列。 每个observer先按完整标签匹配采集成功和年龄可用性，再对共享队列取max。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "未接入 / 无样本",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "fillOpacity": 6,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "统计采集状态（最差observer）",
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "min by (env,cluster,queue_destination) (queue_stats_collection_success{env=~\"${env}\",cluster=~\"${cluster}\",queue_destination=~\"${queue_name}\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{env}} / {{cluster}} · {{queue_destination}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "0表示失败或未知，1才表示可用；无样本保持空白。部分observer失败时也须处理，不被成功副本掩盖。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bool",
          "noValue": "未接入 / 无样本",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "失败 / 未知",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "可用",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mergeValues": true,
        "showValue": "auto",
        "alignValue": "center",
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "精确年龄可用性（最差observer）",
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "min by (env,cluster,queue_destination) (queue_stats_oldest_ready_known{env=~\"${env}\",cluster=~\"${cluster}\",queue_destination=~\"${queue_name}\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{env}} / {{cluster}} · {{queue_destination}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "0表示失败或未知，1才表示可用；无样本保持空白。部分observer失败时也须处理，不被成功副本掩盖。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bool",
          "noValue": "未接入 / 无样本",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 0,
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "失败 / 未知",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "可用",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mergeValues": true,
        "showValue": "auto",
        "alignValue": "center",
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Queue observer 采集明细",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "min by (env,cluster,namespace,app,instance,queue_destination) (queue_stats_collection_success{env=~\"${env}\",cluster=~\"${cluster}\",queue_destination=~\"${queue_name}\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "description": "observer属于采集进程；这里的目标明细与共享库存分开，不把同一库存副本当成每Pod局部任务数。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bool",
          "noValue": "未接入 / 无样本",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "环境"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 55
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "采集集群"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 70
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "应用"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.width",
                "value": 65
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "统计状态"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "失败",
                        "color": "red"
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "成功",
                        "color": "green"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "env": 0,
              "cluster": 1,
              "queue_destination": 2,
              "Value": 3,
              "namespace": 4,
              "app": 5,
              "instance": 6
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "env": "环境",
              "cluster": "采集集群",
              "queue_destination": "逻辑队列",
              "namespace": "命名空间",
              "app": "应用",
              "instance": "采集地址",
              "kafka_cluster": "Kafka集群",
              "consumergroup": "消费组",
              "topic": "Topic",
              "partition": "分区",
              "probe": "探测",
              "Value": "统计状态"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "02 · Kafka Lag — cluster / group / topic / partition",
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "消费组 Topic 总 Lag",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (env,cluster,kafka_cluster,consumergroup,topic) (max by (env,cluster,kafka_cluster,consumergroup,topic,partition) (kafka_consumergroup_lag{env=~\"${env}\",cluster=~\"${cluster}\",kafka_cluster=~\"${kafka_cluster}\",consumergroup=~\"${consumer_group}\",topic=~\"${broker_topic}\"} >= 0))",
          "legendFormat": "{{env}} / {{cluster}} · {{kafka_cluster}} / {{consumergroup}} / {{topic}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "先按同一分区max去exporter副本，再求Topic合计；负值为未知并排除，不当0。缺失分区可能使合计不完整，须同时检查未知分区与exporter抓取状态。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "未接入 / 无样本",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "fillOpacity": 6,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
